      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Fix faces and hands on an existing image\n\n1. Drag the PNG you want to fix onto the Load Image node.\n2. Put the character and style tags in the positive prompt. Tip: open the original PNG in another ComfyUI tab (drag it onto the canvas) to see the exact prompt it was made with, and copy the character and artist lines.\n3. Press Run. Only the face and hands are redrawn; everything else stays as it was. Results are saved as face_fixed_xxxxx.png.\n\nIf the face changes too much, lower denoise to 0.35. If the eyes are still off, raise it to 0.5 or set the seed to randomize and run again.\n\nYour existing images already have Post FX applied, so it is not applied again. The redrawn face and hands have no film grain; if that stands out, un-bypass the Grain only node (select it, Ctrl+B).\n\nHand detailer: runs after the face detailer and redraws each detected hand (guide_size 512, denoise 0.4). If fingers are still wrong, set its seed to randomize and run again, or raise denoise to 0.5. To skip it, select the HandDetailer node and press Ctrl+B."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    },
